        <mxCell id="c88" value="&lt;i&gt;The Checks tab of the model answer after Home &gt; Refresh and Run, scrolled to the 8 rows that start &#x27;as employee006 (Sales Manager)&#x27;, the rows of Guided Tutorial B.1 for the Sales Manager, 270 to 277 of the query&#x27;s 312. The query runs as the file&#x27;s author, so no role applies: each of these rows repeats the role&#x27;s three rules as filters with the user&#x27;s name typed in. Values are written to the cent, and a label longer than its column is cut at the column&#x27;s edge. Outlined: Agrees, true in every row.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="562" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
